"A full English documentation set was added in [Unified SDK "
"Documentation](https://telink-semi.github.io/unisdk-doc/), covering:"
msgstr "完整的英文文档集已添加至 [Unified SDK Documentation](https://telink-semi.github.io/unisdk-doc/)，涵盖："

